## Release History

### Version 0.8.0 (2026-10-14)

Fixed brand-color surface lighting, voice-message playback, semantic data tables and form sizing fixes.

- **New components (2)**: [flow-light](./flow-light.en.mdc), [voice-clip](./voice-clip.en.mdc)
- **Updated components (13)**: base-anchor, base-surface, button, card, conversation-stream, data-table, dropdown-menu, input, number-input, select, tag-input, textarea, voice-beam
- **Key features**:
  - `TxFlowLight` supports corners / rim / aurora, with fixed brand-color lighting forwarded by BaseSurface, Card and menu panels; hidden in high-contrast mode
  - `TxVoiceClip` provides playback, waveform seeking, keyboard controls, local recording decoding and one-at-a-time playback; `TxVoiceBeam` adds independent `organic` motion and respects reduced-motion preferences
  - `TxButton` adds `progress`, `showProgress` and `formatProgress`; `TxConversationStream` measures restored conversation rows on mount
  - `TxDataTable` adds semantic column `type`, per-column `filter` / `filterOptions`, controlled `filter` / `defaultFilter`, and `update:filter` / `filterChange`. Client-side filtering is on by default; `filterOnClient=false` delegates filtering to the caller, and `autoStickyActions` fixes action columns to the right by default
  - `TxSelect` enables search at `searchThreshold` options (8 by default) when `searchable` is omitted; explicit `false` or a nonpositive threshold disables automatic search
  - Input, Textarea, Select, NumberInput and TagInput explicitly use `border-box`, without relying on a host reset or injecting a global wildcard reset
  - After extracting DataTable data state and deduplicating its styles, component JS is 42.9 KiB and full / on-demand CSS is 749.0 / 719.6 KiB; aggregate baselines are 750 / 720.5 KiB, with per-file budgets and import restrictions unchanged


### Version 0.7.0 (2026-10-09)

Motion primitives and the Motion suite, a hover bridge for hover panels, and a terminal display component.

- **New components (16)**: [card-spread](./card-spread.en.mdc), [carousel-3d](./carousel-3d.en.mdc), [flip-book](./flip-book.en.mdc), [morph](./morph.en.mdc), [motion](./motion.en.mdc), [motion-button](./motion-button.en.mdc), [motion-control](./motion-control.en.mdc), [motion-dock](./motion-dock.en.mdc), [motion-form](./motion-form.en.mdc), [motion-loader](./motion-loader.en.mdc), [motion-metric](./motion-metric.en.mdc), [motion-text](./motion-text.en.mdc), [motion-toggle](./motion-toggle.en.mdc), [motion-transition](./motion-transition.en.mdc), [physics-motion](./physics-motion.en.mdc), [terminal](./terminal.en.mdc)
- **Updated components (18)**: [ai-elements](./ai-elements.en.mdc), [base-anchor](./base-anchor.en.mdc), [button](./button.en.mdc), [charts](./charts.en.mdc), [chat](./chat.en.mdc), [code-stream](./code-stream.en.mdc), [flat-dropdown](./flat-dropdown.en.mdc), [fusion-surface](./fusion-surface.en.mdc), [icon-chip](./icon-chip.en.mdc), [icon-morph](./icon-morph.en.mdc), [liquid](./liquid.en.mdc), [popover](./popover.en.mdc), [rating](./rating.en.mdc), [slider](./slider.en.mdc), [steps](./steps.en.mdc), [switch](./switch.en.mdc), [tooltip](./tooltip.en.mdc), [transition](./transition.en.mdc)
- **Motion documentation suite**: navigation adds [Motion](./motion-suite.en.mdc), with individually resettable live specimens and bilingual category, sidebar, overview and demo registration
- **Existing charts module additions**: [dither-chart](./dither-chart.en.mdc) in Motion and [mono-chart](./mono-chart.en.mdc) in Data, both exported through `@talex-touch/tuffex/charts`
- **Installation boundaries**: still the three Base, Pro and AI barrels. Motion is a documentation suite; the `/motion` component subpath imports `TxMotion` and is not a fourth barrel. Composite forms, controls and metrics belong to Pro
- **Sources and licensing**: callers own labels, content, items, models and data. Continuous effects share visibility, reduced-motion and cleanup handling; springs and changing text reuse the existing engines. Adaptations keep Amicro's MIT attribution and source-file Apache-2.0 notices; the 46 preserved Lucide glyphs keep ISC and applicable Feather-MIT notices, with no React or Lucide runtime dependency
- **Key features**:
  - Closed-form springs (`solveSpring`, `createSpringTrack`) and `useMorphBox`; TxMorph keeps one shape across states; TxTransitionSmoothSize runs on springs and gains a blur transition
  - Hover panels render a bridge to their trigger and guard diagonal travel with a safe triangle; the anchor family draws no arrow by default, and the expand bounce is capped by panel height
  - TuffSwitch's thumb rides the glide material, TxSlider overdrags on a rubber band, TxLineSeries draws its stroke in, TxIconMorph adds play and pause, and TxCopyButton morphs between copy, copied and failed
  - TxTerminal shares ANSI / Unicode terminal display between the web and Electron

