## Version Gate and Standards

| Rule | Enforced by |
|------|-------------|
| A version bump adds a matching chapter to `CHANGELOG.md` and this page | `audit:changelog`, blocking CI and publish |
| Each version chapter lists the components it added or updated | `audit:changelog` |
| Component doc Since values match this index and never exceed the current version | `audit:changelog` |
| Chinese and English pages keep the same heading structure | CI static check |
